Datasets in this directory
==========================

stations.json.gz, bus_stations.json.gz, lodging.json.gz
  Derived from OpenStreetMap data via the Overpass API.
  © OpenStreetMap contributors. Available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/  —  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  These derived databases are themselves made available under the ODbL 1.0.

retiring_rooms.json.gz
  Station list from IRCTC's public retiring-room portal (https://www.rr.irctc.co.in/), refreshed manually.
  Coordinates joined from the OpenStreetMap stations above (ODbL 1.0, © OpenStreetMap contributors).

airports.json.gz
  From OurAirports (https://ourairports.com/data/), released into the public domain.

xotelo_keys.json.gz (when present)
  Location keys and centres derived from Xotelo API responses (https://xotelo.com).

Rebuild with `npm run build:data` (see README). Build dates and row counts are in manifest.json.
